      \u0275\u0275domElementStart(5, "p");
      \u0275\u0275text(6, "Backups get you back up and running. Archiving proves what was said. When an auditor, regulator, court or HR investigation asks for an email from three years ago, you need a complete, untouched copy \u2014 including the ones someone deleted \u2014 and you need to find it fast. XcellHost Email Archiving captures every inbound and outbound message at the server level as it happens, stores it in immutable, encrypted storage outside your mail platform, and keeps it for as long as your policy says. Search across mail, attachments and metadata instantly, place custodians on legal hold, and export exactly what\u2019s asked for \u2014 with a full audit trail.");
      \u0275\u0275domElementEnd()();
