      \u0275\u0275text(8, " (formerly Azure Active Directory) is Microsoft\u2019s cloud identity and access management service. It gives every employee, partner and customer a single, secure identity they use to sign in to your apps \u2014 Microsoft 365, thousands of SaaS tools and your own applications \u2014 with single sign-on, so there\u2019s one login instead of dozens of passwords.");
