var PRIVATE_FAQS = [["Do I need Entra ID P1 or P2 as well?", "Yes. Each Private Access user also needs Entra ID P1 or P2. P1 comes with Microsoft 365 Business Premium, E3, F1/F3 and EMS E3; P2 with Microsoft 365 E5 and EMS E5. If you don't have either, we can add P1 on the same invoice."], ["Which apps and protocols does it support?", "Any app that uses TCP or UDP \u2014 RDP, SSH, SMB file shares, SAP GUI, SQL and other databases, internal websites and custom line-of-business protocols. The app itself doesn't change."], ["Do I have to open any inbound firewall ports?", "No. The private network connector is a lightweight agent on Windows Server that makes outbound connections over port 443 only. Nothing on your network needs to accept inbound connections from the internet."], ["How many connectors do we need?", "At least two per site, placed in a connector group, so one can be patched or fail without cutting access. Busy sites may need more. Connectors are free \u2014 you license users, not servers. Use the planner above for a starting point."], ["What's the difference between Quick Access and per-app access?", "Quick Access is a single app object holding the FQDNs, IPs and ranges you want to tunnel \u2014 the fastest way to replace a VPN. Per-app access gives each app its own object, user assignment and Conditional Access policy for proper least-privilege segmentation. Most customers start with Quick Access and move key apps to per-app segments."], ["Can it run alongside our current VPN?", "Yes. You can run both while you migrate group by group, then retire the VPN when traffic has moved across. We plan the cut-over with you."], ["Does it protect users on the office network too?", "Yes. With intelligent local access, users on the corporate LAN still get MFA and Conditional Access for private apps, while traffic stays local instead of hair-pinning through the cloud."], ["Which devices are supported?", "The Global Secure Access client runs on Windows, macOS, iOS and Android. We help you deploy it through Intune or your existing device management."], ["Do I get a GST invoice, and can I pay monthly?", "Yes to both. Choose monthly billing at \u20B9378 per user, or yearly upfront at \u20B94,382 per user. Prices are indicative and exclude 18% GST."]];

