    <div class="sh rv"><span class="eyebrow">Conditional Access</span><h2>Write the rule once. <span class="acc">Every sign-in follows it.</span></h2><p>A Conditional Access policy is a plain if-then statement: <b>if</b> these users open these apps under these conditions, <b>then</b> grant, challenge or block. Build one below and watch five sample sign-ins react.</p></div>
