<section class="sec" id="india">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sh rv"><span class="eyebrow">Before you buy \xB7 India</span><h2>You may already own P1. <span class="acc">Use it properly.</span></h2><p>Many Indian businesses pay for P1 inside their Microsoft 365 plan and never switch on a single Conditional Access policy. Check first \u2014 then put it to work for your regulators.</p></div>
    <div class="in-grid">
      <div class="have rv">
        <span class="ck2">Do you already have P1?</span>
        <h3>It's included in these plans</h3>
        <div class="incl">
          <span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></i>Microsoft 365 Business Premium</span>
          <span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></i>Microsoft 365 E3</span>
          <span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></i>Microsoft 365 E5 <small>(as P2)</small></span>
          <span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></i>Microsoft 365 F1 / F3</span>
          <span><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></i>EMS E3 / E5</span>
        </div>
        <p>On Business Standard, Basic or Office 365 E1/E3? Buy P1 only for the users you want to protect \u2014 or compare an upgrade. We'll tell you which is cheaper.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-orange" data-open="xhCallback" data-topic="Free licence review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"></path></svg> Book a free licence review</button>
      </div>
      <div class="reg rv" data-d="2">
        <div class="rg"><div class="ico n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 22V4M4 4h12l-2 4 2 4H4"></path></svg></div><div><h3>CERT-In directions</h3><p>Sign-in and audit logs help you investigate within the 6-hour reporting window. P1 keeps them for 30 days; we can set up streaming to storage in an Indian Azure region so you can hold them for 180 days.</p></div></div>
        <div class="rg"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"></path><path d="M14 7h7v7"></path></svg></div><div><h3>DPDP Act 2023</h3><p>Conditional Access and MFA are practical access controls for personal data, and every sign-in leaves an audit trail you can show when asked.</p></div></div>
        <div class="rg"><div class="ico o"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="1"></rect><path d="M9 7h.01M15 7h.01M9 11h.01M15 11h.01M9 15h.01M15 15h.01M10 21v-3h4v3"></path></svg></div><div><h3>RBI, SEBI &amp; IRDAI guidance</h3><p>Regulated entities are expected to use MFA for remote and privileged access. P1 covers MFA and admin policies; access reviews and PIM need <a href="/microsoft-entra-id">P2</a> or <a href="/microsoft-entra-id-governance">ID Governance</a>.</p></div></div>
        <p class="fine">P1 helps you meet these expectations; it doesn't make you compliant on its own. Your auditor has the final word.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
