var P1_FAQS = [["We have Microsoft 365 Business Premium. Do we need to buy P1?", "No. Business Premium, Microsoft 365 E3, F1/F3 and EMS E3 already include P1, and E5 includes P2. You only need standalone P1 for users on plans without it, such as Business Basic or Standard. Ask for a free licence review and we'll check your tenant."], ["Does every user need a P1 licence?", "Every user who benefits from a P1 feature needs one \u2014 for example, anyone covered by a Conditional Access policy or using password reset with writeback. You can mix: P1 for the users you protect, Free for the rest, though most businesses licence everyone so policies cover the whole organisation."], ["What's the difference between P1 and P2?", "P2 includes everything in P1 and adds ID Protection (risk-based Conditional Access, leaked-credential and impossible-travel detection), Privileged Identity Management for just-in-time admin access, and access reviews. See the P2 page."], ["Could a Conditional Access policy lock everyone out?", `It can if it's rushed. We start every policy in report-only mode, create two emergency "break-glass" admin accounts excluded from policies, pilot with a small group and only then enforce \u2014 so you see the impact before anyone is blocked.`], ["What does password writeback need on-premises?", "A synchronisation server running Entra Connect (or Entra Cloud Sync) with writeback turned on, and the right permissions on your Active Directory. We check your setup during onboarding and enable it for you."], ["Which MFA methods are included?", "Microsoft Authenticator push with number matching, passkeys and FIDO2 security keys, Windows Hello for Business, OATH hardware and software tokens, and SMS or voice calls. You decide which ones your users may register."], ["Monthly or yearly \u2014 what's the difference?", "Monthly billing charges \u20B9528 per user each month. Yearly charges \u20B96,125 per user for 12 months upfront, which works out cheaper. Both are below Microsoft's list price; commitment and cancellation terms are confirmed on your quotation."], ["Do I get a GST invoice?", "Yes. Every order comes with a GST-compliant invoice from XcellHost Cloud Services Pvt. Ltd. Prices shown are indicative and exclude 18% GST; pay by UPI, card, net banking or bank transfer."]];

